WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.540
Full Moon has a show at
a university's school festival.

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:07.040
But there are some weirdos
among the students

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:09.070
that put her in some
dangerous situations!

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.970
Takuto thinks fast and
turns into his human form

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.770
to act as Mitsuki's bodyguard,
so nothing goes wrong, but...

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.200
Why are you always all about Mitsuki?!
You're mine, Takuto!

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.700
So, I wonder what's
going to happen today...

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:28.540
Got that?

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:29.540
Yes.

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:07.300
Good job today!

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:08.440
- Good job!
- Good job!

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:10.070
Oh, here she comes!

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:11.200
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.200
Are all you done?
Let's hurry and go here!

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:15.240
I heard it's famous for
its super spicy ramen!

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:18.000
I would rather go to this Taiyaki place.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:21.340
Sure, I can't eat unless
you go with me anyway.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.540
Oh yeah! How about
going to both places!

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:25.570
How about it, Takuto?

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:26.270
Okay, okay.

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:27.700
Go to both places?

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.000
Say, I haven't seen Madoka lately.

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:33.040
Madoka? Who's that?

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:34.970
Oh no, did you forget her?

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:39.700
That one that competed with Full Moon
to release a CD... Madoka Wakamatsu.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:42.140
Oh, right, right!

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.740
I wonder what she's up to?
We haven't heard anything about her.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:46.200
Maybe she's retiring.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.470
Maybe.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:49.740
<i>Retiring?</i>

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.870
Huh? Madoka Wakamatsu?

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.800
Yes, I wonder what she's
been doing since then.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:03.970
Is it bothering you?

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:06.370
Well...yes.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:11.270
I understand how you feel, but it's not
something you should be worried about.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.740
Even if something
like that happened.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.770
I'm a bit shocked that Ms. Oshige
said such a cold thing.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.940
Really? I think that's logical.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.800
Even you're saying that?

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.800
Well, it won't do much to worry, right?

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:38.900
Well... That's true, but...

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:42.070
Yeah. Why are you even
worrying about her

00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:44.000
after she did all sorts of
mean things to you?

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.840
Yeah, you're right.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:48.600
<i>But...</i>

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.870
<i>I can't stop worrying about</i>
<i>what happened to her.</i>

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:06.240
Oh, over there!

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:09.040
Wow, it's so crowded!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.040
They must really be good!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.500
Don't they look like they
are from the industry?

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:16.540
I can't take this anymore!

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.470
Wait, Madoka!

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:22.040
Wait!

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:24.270
<i>Madoka!</i>

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.670
You have to go back, Madoka.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:32.570
But I can't stand spicy things!
I can't eat that!

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:35.700
I don't know what
your previous manager was like,

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.100
but I won't let you be so selfish!

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.340
Whatever!

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:42.600
Ms. Sasaki would've never
made me do this kind of job!

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:45.340
She took better care
of me as a talent!

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:46.570
Madoka...

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.540
Well, at least she hasn't retired.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:51.540
Looks like she has
a new manager as well.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.870
She's reporting, huh?

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:56.370
No fair! She gets to eat
that super spicy ramen for free!

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.970
Ms. Imamura,
we are going to take a break now.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:02.770
All right.
I'm very sorry.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.970
What are you doing?
Did you come to eat ramen?

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:08.440
Huh? Oh...

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.600
Or, I don't suppose you're
Madoka Wakamatsu's fan?

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:15.040
No, you can't be, right?
That ex-idol on the downgrade.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.200
D-Downgrade?

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.470
You can call it going downhill too.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:26.500
Listen, Madoka.
Ms. Sasaki didn't care about you.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:29.100
She was just spoiling you.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.370
Understood? Now go back to work.

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:35.570
I can't take this anymore.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:36.640
What?

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.640
I quit!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.770
Madoka?!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.140
I don't want to be doing
these kinds of worthless jobs.

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.070
Don't say such nonsense!

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:44.800
Bye.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:49.100
Madoka!
Come back, Madoka.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:49.800
No.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:53.200
I don't want to do it anymore,
so I won't go back!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.370
Where do you think you're going?

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.140
Goodbye!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.070
Madoka, you are coming back here!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.340
Do you hear me?
You are coming back!

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:35.800
What the heck?

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:38.240
Can't at least one person
come running after me?

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:54.400
What is it?!
What do you want from me?

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.070
U-Umm...

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:04.470
Hey, are you okay?

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.140
You shouldn't have
pushed yourself that much.

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.570
I-I'm all right.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:08.440
Hey...

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:13.600
Are you all right?
Are you not feeling well?

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.140
Wow, the pizza is so red.

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:30.240
Didn't she say she
couldn't stand spicy food?

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.040
Here, eat, eat!

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.070
Yeah.

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.070
So huge.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:42.100
Oh, any normal idol would eat that.

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:43.240
Really?!

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:44.970
Is that so?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.570
Oh yeah, you didn't know?

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.800
How nice!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.200
I didn't know that.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:55.140
Why are you being so clueless?
You're an idol too, aren't you?

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:56.170
Oh, that's right.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.140
- Did you say something?
- Oh, no!

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:06.570
You're a bit strange.
So, what were you talking about?

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:07.500
What?

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:10.970
You were talking with the staff, right?
At the ramen shop.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:13.640
So, what were you talking about?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:16.470
Well... Umm... That's...

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:20.400
<i>I don't suppose you're</i>
<i>Madoka Wakamatsu's fan?</i>

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.700
<i>No, you can't be, right?</i>
<i>That ex-idol on the downgrade.</i>

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:24.400
<i>What?</i>

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.440
<i>You can call it</i>
<i>going downhill too.</i>

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:33.140
<i>I can't tell her such</i>
<i>a horrible thing.</i>

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.740
No, nothing out of the ordinary.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.400
I'll determine if it's out
of the ordinary or not.

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:41.940
So just tell me!

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.200
Umm...

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:47.300
We were just saying what
a wonderful person you are, Madoka.

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:52.100
Oh, really? Of course.
Some people can actually see that.

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:53.870
And you?

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:54.740
Huh?

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.840
What do you mean, "huh?"
Aren't you my fan?

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:00.370
Tell her no. Just tell her clearly.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:03.040
Yeah, or else this woman
will get carried away again.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.000
Don't hesitate to tell me the truth.

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.570
Yes...that's right.

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.140
Hey, don't be idiotic now.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:17.300
Yeah, women like her only take things
the way they want to!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:20.040
Yeah! I knew it!

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.600
You see?

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.200
So, you must be like,
"oh my god,"

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:28.170
after meeting your idol
Madoka Wakamatsu, right?

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:34.040
Miss, I'm so sorry!

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:38.370
Sorry.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:55.570
Here you go.

00:10:55.740 --> 00:10:56.970
Thank you.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:02.870
It's delicious!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.670
That's an outfit I wore for
a role when I as a kid.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.070
I'm glad it fits.

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:10.400
Thank you so much for this.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.040
No, no problem.
But that was terrible.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:15.000
Yes.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.240
You're the one who drenched her!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.000
Oh? A message?

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:21.470
Who could it be?

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:26.100
<i>Madoka, it's your mother.</i>
<i>How are you?</i>

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:30.700
<i>You haven't called in so long,</i>
<i>I started worrying. How is work going?</i>

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:33.140
<i>We got a bunch of persimmons,</i>
<i>so I'll send some to you.</i>

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:35.940
<i>I'll send some to</i>
<i>your new manager as well.</i>

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:37.600
<i>Please call me sometime.</i>

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.400
<i>Hello. Delivery!</i>

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:49.500
Oh, okay.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.240
Here we go.

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:55.700
Wow, so many persimmons!

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:56.400
Wanna try them?

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:57.400
Sure.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:58.940
Thank you!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:07.370
These persimmons your mother
sent are so delicious.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.340
Really?

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:11.670
Madoka...

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:12.370
Hmm?

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.340
What are you going to do now?

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.700
Dashing out in the middle of work...

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:24.700
It's just that,
I want to become an idol.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.200
I wanna wear pretty dresses
and have the spotlight on me.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.870
And have many fans,
and people who copy me.

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:34.370
And I wanna always have
the attention of the media.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.600
After running away from the workplace,
what the heck is she talking about?

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.400
She thinks being a singer is easy.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:43.400
Recently, I've been thinking maybe
it's better to be an actress than a singer.

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:45.040
What do you think?
Wouldn't I make a great actress?

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:46.740
She thinks being
an actress is easy too!

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:48.770
How audacious of her!

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.400
So singing...

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.740
So you aren't going to sing anymore?

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:56.000
I'm done singing.

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:00.540
Oh, Gu!

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.140
You know Gu?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:06.640
Oh, no, I've only seen you
holding him in a magazine.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:11.800
Huh? What?

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.870
Does he see us?

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:16.900
That can't be.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.070
You really are my fan, aren't you?

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:20.800
No!

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:23.800
- I'm impressed. Make yourself at home.
- Hey! Meroko!

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:24.500
Y-Yes.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.900
Gu!

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.900
Can you be quiet please?

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:32.470
I'm saved.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.370
What a shrewd pig.

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:46.040
These videos are so valuable now!

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.240
Madoka... You're so beautiful.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.400
Oh? R-Really?

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:01.040
It's a little embarrassing
when people remind me.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:25.900
What are you doing?!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:33.940
Madoka?

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:39.600
Yeah! This is the song that I competed
against Full Moon with and lost.

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:41.670
Doesn't it amuse you to hear it?

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:42.640
But...

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:46.970
Sorry for raising my voice.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:51.340
Oh, yeah, you must be thirsty, right?
I'll go buy something.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:53.600
Madoka!

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:56.170
Takuto!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.640
Sorry, I have to go after Madoka.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:14:59.670
Wait!

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:04.500
Meroko is going after her.
Read this before you go.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.670
What's this?

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:14.240
"September 18th.
A new song. Such a wonderful song."

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:17.340
"I'm so lucky to be able to
sing this as my debut song."

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.000
Takuto, is this...

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:27.570
"I want to study a lot of things to
get a better image for this song."

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:31.040
<i>Mr. Takasu disapproved of</i>
<i>my performance today.</i>

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:35.000
<i>But Mr. Takasu is</i>
<i>my most reliable producer.</i>

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:41.070
<i>He scolds me because he cares about me.</i>
<i>I have to meet his expectations.</i>

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:47.170
<i>November 30th.</i>
<i>I can't hit the high notes well.</i>

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:50.600
<i>I should've done my vocal</i>
<i>exercises more thoroughly.</i>

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:52.240
<i>I'm regretting that.</i>

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:57.200
Madoka, you cared about
"Eternal Snow" so much.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:10.400
I'm so frustrated.
So frustrated! So frustrated.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:15.000
What do I do?
Just what can I do?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:21.700
Now, everything is over.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.100
What?

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:56.040
Is it funny...that I'm crying?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:01.700
Why don't you sing "Eternal Snow"?

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:03.870
I want to sing it too!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.000
But I can't anymore!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.970
After all, I've lost.
I lost to myself!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:14.570
I didn't lose to Full Moon.

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:19.140
That's right.
I didn't lose to Full Moon.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.670
<i>You can't believe in me,</i>
<i>can you?</i>

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:26.500
<i>Well...</i>

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.600
<i>I believed in you.</i>

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.140
<i>I believed in your power.</i>

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.770
Madoka... Please sing.

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:57.670
You said a moment ago that
you wanted to sing, right?

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.540
I want to hear your song too!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:02.640
My song?

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:05.970
I think...

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.170
that everyone
has a unique song.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.540
2There's a song for Full Moon.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:18.640
But I think that there's also
a song that only you can sing.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:22.870
I want to hear your song.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:30.570
<i>You better think again</i>
<i>why you want to sing.</i>

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:34.070
<i>That's all I can say.</i>

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:38.970
That's what he meant.

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:46.840
I have a feeling that once I hear your song,
I'll like you even more!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.100
What a statement.

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:51.940
But who on earth are you?

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.700
I'm one of your fans.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:56.940
I see.

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:01.740
But there might be no place
to go back to anymore.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.570
That's not true!

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:06.940
There must be lots of people
waiting for you!

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:08.340
You think so?

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:09.370
Yes!

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:11.340
Everybody is waiting for you!

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:13.270
I'm sure they're waiting! I'm sure.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:20.970
It's so late,
I'm sure no one is still waiting.

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:27.670
Ms. Imamura?

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:32.670
Ms. Imamura!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:33.600
Madoka?

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:37.200
You came back.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:39.900
I'm sorry.

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:42.940
It's all right.
I'm so glad you came back.

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:44.470
Ms. Imamura...

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:45.700
Yes?

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.440
I want to sing!

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:52.870
I was waiting for you to say that.

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:59.100
You had been running away.
You were scared of singing.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:02.800
But it won't do you any good to run away.

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:06.200
That's why I was strict with you,
believing that one day,

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.870
you would tell me
that you wanted to sing.

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:13.970
I had no idea. I'm sorry.

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:16.170
I'm sorry!

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:20.140
Now, let's go to Mr. Takasu's,
shall we?

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:25.800
Mr. Takasu must be
waiting for you too.

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:30.970
Yes!

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:39.270
And today's show's director is...

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.170
Oh, Madoka!

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.940
Madoka! Good morning!

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:50.900
I've been wanting to
tell you this for a while.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:51.670
Yes?

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:56.340
All this time, I thought of you as
an inept idol with just a pretty face.

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:57.040
Huh?

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.500
But maybe you are pretty
talented as a singer.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:03.340
That's what I started
to think recently!

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:06.770
But I will not lose to you,
no matter what!

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:14.000
What was that?

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:18.170
Well, I guess that's
her way of greeting you.

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.270
Greeting me?

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.070
It means she acknowledges you!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:25.370
She's so insincere.
Though, who am I to say this?

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:28.970
Madoka...

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:11.300
Oh no, Takuto! Looks like Mitsuki's illness
has suddenly gotten worse!

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:14.000
What?! Have you
contacted that doctor?!

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:18.740
Well... Just when we need Dr. Wakaoji,
we can't get a hold of him!

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.900
Jeez! Where is he
at such a critical time?!

00:23:22.070 --> 00:23:25.400
If we don't do something,
they will force her to get the operation!

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:30.600
Next time on Full Moon:
"The Illness Advances."

00:23:31.440 --> 00:23:32.440
- Look forward to it!
- Look forward to it!
